;Stage sprites originally come from 
;"Capoeira Fighter 3 - Ultimate World Tournament" game.
;They have just been modified and programmed into Mugen by me.
;
;What exactly I did besides the programming and general work?
;
;- Added some light effects.
;
;If you enjoy the stage, go and buy CF3 game. It's really great!
;
;http://www.spiritonin.com/capoeirafighter/
